      en: 'On the model: polished gold (to be confirmed on the specimen)'
    philosophy:
      id: '[Draf] Diisi kurator setelah spesimen asli ditetapkan.'
      en: '[Draft] To be written by the curator once the real specimen is chosen.'
    craft:
      id: Pegangan keris berupa figur dewa bermahkota bertingkat (kruna) yang berlutut
        dengan tangan menyembah, lengkap dengan kalung, sabuk, dan gelang. Identifikasi
        figurnya perlu dikonfirmasi kurator.
      en: The keris handle in the form of a deity with a tiered crown (kruna), kneeling
        with hands in worship, with necklace, belt and bracelets. The identification
        of the figure needs curator confirmation.
    history:
      id: '[Draf] Diisi kurator setelah spesimen asli ditetapkan.'
