    philosophy:
      id: '[Draf] Diisi kurator setelah spesimen asli ditetapkan.'
      en: '[Draft] To be written by the curator once the real specimen is chosen.'
    craft:
      id: Lekukan bilah berjumlah ganjil - model ini 9 luk dengan panjang 40 cm.
        Punggungan di tengah bilah disebut adeg-adeg, bidang rata di kiri-kanannya
        bilik, dan tepinya kikis.
      en: The blade waves are always odd in number - this model has 9, 40 cm long.
        The central ridge is the adeg-adeg, the flat areas beside it the bilik, and
        the edges the kikis.
